<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company held its Annual Meeting on October
11, 2024. Of the 16,791,964 shares of Common Stock outstanding on September 23, 2024, the record date, 9,642,977 shares were represented
at the Annual Meeting, in person or by proxy, constituting a quorum. The proposals considered at the Annual Meeting are described in detail
in the Proxy Statement. The proposals described below were voted upon at the Annual Meeting and the number of votes cast with respect
to each proposal was as set forth below:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

